WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
I haven’t been back to the imperial capital for a long time.

2
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:07,440
Some are curious about what happened in the imperial capital

3
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:10,140
You don't mean to take it from us

4
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:12,580
It's normal to inquire about Princess Mingyue.

5
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:14,300
When this incident first came out

6
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:15,380
Shocked the entire imperial capital

7
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:17,300
You are the insider of this mission again

8
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,380
Another person from the imperial capital

9
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:21,220
Isn't it abnormal to not be curious? Can you tell me something?

10
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,820
If it's something confidential

11
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:24,740
I really can't tell you but this

12
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:26,580
Now it is almost a national ring

13
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:28,180
Even Prince Tamu knows about it

14
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,140
Of course it’s not a secret

15
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:30,500
Nothing to do now

16
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:31,660
I can talk to you

17
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,500
I know that Princess Mingyue was caught and she was thinking about it

18
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,380
I'm a little curious about what will happen to those who were caught.

19
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:36,730
Get caught and end up

20
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:39,480
Then you've asked the right person.

21
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:42,700
On the surface

22
00:00:43,290 --> 00:00:45,850
Everyone has heard about Count Capt.

23
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:48,350
Because Princess Mingyue begged for mercy

24
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:50,070
Imprisoned in a prison

25
00:00:50,830 --> 00:00:53,510
But an acquaintance of mine told me

26
00:00:53,910 --> 00:00:55,990
On the night when the count was imprisoned

27
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:57,990
Someone took him out of the prison

28
00:00:58,230 --> 00:01:00,950
He was secretly executed by His Majesty
